WEBVTT

00:01:32.880 --> 00:01:34.300
Wow!

00:01:34.550 --> 00:01:38.170
They're all just beyond cute!

00:01:39.600 --> 00:01:41.940
Kana took these secretly 
and neatly, you know!

00:01:42.430 --> 00:01:44.810
This is Hina-Ichigo 
stealing a bite to eat.

00:01:45.050 --> 00:01:47.780
This one is Suiseiseki changing.

00:01:47.780 --> 00:01:50.940
And it was a bit of a chore
without being caught, I guess.

00:01:51.460 --> 00:01:53.220
The Rozen Maiden dolls...

00:01:54.720 --> 00:01:57.100
I wish they'd all hurry 
up and come over!

00:01:57.310 --> 00:01:58.960
I can't wait!

00:02:00.880 --> 00:02:03.530
<i>I have to work hard and
get serious about it soon.</i>

00:02:09.500 --> 00:02:13.960
F-For now, I should move forward
with caution, I guess.

00:02:17.140 --> 00:02:19.850
Tea Party

00:02:20.070 --> 00:02:21.960
Like this and this.

00:02:21.960 --> 00:02:24.800
The key is to knead it thoroughly.

00:02:24.800 --> 00:02:26.090
L-Like this?

00:02:26.350 --> 00:02:28.910
Circles, triangles, squares...

00:02:28.910 --> 00:02:32.090
We're gonna make tasty cookies!

00:02:32.840 --> 00:02:35.660
Oh my, Hina,
 you're so good at this.

00:02:35.900 --> 00:02:39.240
Shinku-chan, care to 
make cookies with us?

00:02:39.240 --> 00:02:40.470
It's no use.

00:02:40.740 --> 00:02:42.990
Shinku wouldn't do that.

00:02:42.990 --> 00:02:47.430
She'd just say, "No, thank you.
It would soil my dress."

00:02:47.430 --> 00:02:48.160
That sounds fine.

00:02:48.160 --> 00:02:50.120
See? Like I said.

00:03:01.550 --> 00:03:03.120
W-What?

00:03:03.410 --> 00:03:04.190
"What"...

00:03:04.590 --> 00:03:05.890
What a surprise!

00:03:06.140 --> 00:03:08.970
To think Shinku would make cookies
of her own will!

00:03:08.970 --> 00:03:10.900
What in the world made you do this?

00:03:11.600 --> 00:03:13.990
Th-This is just a whim.

00:03:13.990 --> 00:03:15.760
There's no deep meaning.

00:03:16.860 --> 00:03:19.700
But, but you look good in an apron!

00:03:19.700 --> 00:03:21.470
Really. It's cute.

00:03:22.190 --> 00:03:23.900
R-Really.

00:03:24.510 --> 00:03:27.210
So? What must I do?

00:03:27.630 --> 00:03:30.820
Well then,
 could you knead the dough?

00:03:30.820 --> 00:03:31.950
All right.

00:03:43.520 --> 00:03:47.200
Oh, this is so irritating! 
How pathetic are you?

00:03:48.560 --> 00:03:50.670
Nothing but lowly cookie dough...

00:03:51.170 --> 00:03:52.900
...and you would defy me?

00:03:56.570 --> 00:03:58.310
No! It's smoky!

00:03:59.530 --> 00:04:01.410
What do you think you're doing?

00:04:01.410 --> 00:04:03.410
I-It cannot be helped.

00:04:03.410 --> 00:04:05.500
T-This is my first time.

00:04:05.500 --> 00:04:07.820
F-Forget that!
 Open the windows already!

00:04:11.200 --> 00:04:15.200
This is the 456th time, and this day
has finally come, I guess.

00:04:18.870 --> 00:04:21.800
I'll show you Kana's true powers!

00:04:21.800 --> 00:04:23.270
Prepare yourselves!

00:04:29.070 --> 00:04:30.020
Oh...

00:04:32.330 --> 00:04:34.180
S-Shinku!

00:04:34.490 --> 00:04:36.900
Oh, it's Kanaria!

00:04:36.900 --> 00:04:38.410
What have you come here for?

00:04:38.780 --> 00:04:41.190
K-Kana was, well...

00:04:47.250 --> 00:04:49.320
T-This is perfect, I guess!

00:04:49.810 --> 00:04:52.020
With all of you here,
 it's my chance now!

00:04:52.020 --> 00:04:54.570
I'll take you all on!

00:04:56.130 --> 00:04:57.170
It's done baking!

00:04:57.170 --> 00:04:59.010
Cookies are done!

00:05:01.940 --> 00:05:04.110
Since you're here, 
why not have some?

00:05:05.160 --> 00:05:08.680
It seems my greatest masterpiece
has finished baking.

00:05:11.800 --> 00:05:12.750
Nori.

00:05:13.000 --> 00:05:14.820
Please serve her my cookies.

00:05:23.980 --> 00:05:26.980
As expected, mine look 
the most delicious.

00:05:26.980 --> 00:05:30.600
Hina's flower cookies came out good too!

00:05:32.620 --> 00:05:34.730
What is this?

00:05:35.000 --> 00:05:35.870
A pig?

00:05:37.150 --> 00:05:39.070
How rude.
 That's Kun-kun.

00:05:39.660 --> 00:05:41.010
Kun-kun?

00:05:42.300 --> 00:05:43.390
Yay!

00:05:44.790 --> 00:05:47.600
<i>T-To think things would 
turn out this way...</i>

00:05:47.600 --> 00:05:49.880
<i>It's beyond the scope of 
what I had anticipated.</i>

00:05:50.520 --> 00:05:51.380
<i>Shinku...</i>

00:05:51.900 --> 00:05:54.580
<i>What could she be thinking?</i>

00:05:54.730 --> 00:05:55.620
Here.

00:05:55.870 --> 00:05:59.420
Kanaria-chan, have them 
while they're still hot.

00:05:59.790 --> 00:06:02.060
Hina made those, 
you know.

00:06:02.210 --> 00:06:03.400
They're delicious!

00:06:03.650 --> 00:06:05.380
I-I see.

00:06:06.710 --> 00:06:11.370
<i>C-Could it be that something
has been done to these cookies?</i>

00:06:12.070 --> 00:06:14.680
Here, they're strangely tasty...

00:06:14.680 --> 00:06:16.850
Hurry up and eat them...

00:06:19.520 --> 00:06:23.180
I-I-I'm not falling for that trick!

00:06:25.480 --> 00:06:29.420
<i>C-Could it be that this 
tea is the real trap?</i>

00:06:32.200 --> 00:06:37.480
Oh, I feel really sleepy 
for some reason, I guess.

00:06:40.680 --> 00:06:42.160
Asleep at last.

00:06:42.160 --> 00:06:45.600
Now's our chance to 
take her Rosa Mystica!

00:06:45.900 --> 00:06:49.090
Tactician, my butt.
 How laughable.

00:06:49.090 --> 00:06:51.740
Ha ha!
 Stupid! Stupid!

00:06:58.330 --> 00:07:00.180
Too bad for you!

00:07:00.900 --> 00:07:05.860
You thought Kanaria, the brainiest
Rozen Maiden, would fall...

00:07:06.680 --> 00:07:08.480
What are you doing?

00:07:08.480 --> 00:07:09.900
Shut up.

00:07:09.900 --> 00:07:11.930
Come on, come on,
 open your mouth, you!

00:07:14.360 --> 00:07:15.860
Yuck!

00:07:15.860 --> 00:07:18.070
So it's as I thought.

00:07:18.070 --> 00:07:21.200
Shinku made those cookies.

00:07:23.290 --> 00:07:25.420
What do you mean "as you thought"?

00:07:25.710 --> 00:07:28.510
I-I utterly committed 
myself to making those.

00:07:29.140 --> 00:07:32.740
I-I will make them more delicious
next time. You'll see.

00:07:35.350 --> 00:07:39.140
Shinku's acting sort of weird today.

00:07:39.600 --> 00:07:40.560
Yeah...

00:07:41.350 --> 00:07:42.160
But...

00:07:44.490 --> 00:07:46.460
Well, I think it's fine.

00:07:47.100 --> 00:07:49.890
Huh? You're leaving already?

00:07:50.490 --> 00:07:53.100
I-I'll let you off the 
hook for today, I guess!

00:07:53.780 --> 00:07:55.340
But just remember.

00:07:55.800 --> 00:07:58.810
Next time, I'll defeat you all for sure.

00:08:00.580 --> 00:08:01.280
Indeed.

00:08:01.980 --> 00:08:04.780
Then next time, I will be waiting
with scones in the oven.

00:08:15.480 --> 00:08:16.790
What's with her?

00:08:16.790 --> 00:08:18.840
Mocking me like that!

00:08:19.090 --> 00:08:20.100
Kanaria.

00:08:21.320 --> 00:08:22.740
Souseiseki.

00:08:23.560 --> 00:08:24.530
What do you want?

00:08:24.530 --> 00:08:26.900
Come to invite me
 to a picnic now?

00:08:27.610 --> 00:08:29.960
I'm not Shinku.

00:08:30.390 --> 00:08:32.310
Would you tell me one thing?

00:08:33.810 --> 00:08:36.940
Do you seriously intend to fight us?

00:08:36.940 --> 00:08:40.310
Of course! 
So what of it?

00:08:42.950 --> 00:08:45.160
If that's what you want, 
it can't be helped.

00:08:45.510 --> 00:08:48.060
But remember one thing.

00:08:49.270 --> 00:08:52.390
When the Alice Game is over,
we will definitely lose someone.

00:08:52.920 --> 00:08:56.380
We will never be able to go back
to the way we are now.

00:08:58.560 --> 00:09:01.190
I know that without you telling me!

00:09:08.660 --> 00:09:11.140
Shinku-chan and the 
others baked cookies?

00:09:11.630 --> 00:09:13.020
That's incredible!

00:09:13.020 --> 00:09:14.860
I didn't know
they could do that too!

00:09:15.060 --> 00:09:16.880
I wish I could've had some too!

00:09:17.980 --> 00:09:22.360
B-But it might be better to
stay away from Shinku's, I guess?

00:09:22.870 --> 00:09:26.730
When everyone comes over,
I'd want to cook with them for sure!

00:09:26.960 --> 00:09:31.000
And I'll have them wear all sorts of outfits
and take tons of photos!

00:09:31.000 --> 00:09:32.690
And also... And also...

00:09:32.690 --> 00:09:36.300
Oh, just thinking about 
it makes me so...

00:09:37.860 --> 00:09:41.800
<i>To get them, I have no choice
but to win the Alice Game.</i>

00:09:42.140 --> 00:09:43.780
<i>But if I do that...</i>

00:09:44.310 --> 00:09:48.110
<i>When the Alice Game is over,
we will definitely lose someone.</i>

00:09:48.690 --> 00:09:52.220
<i>We will never be able to go back
to the way we are now.</i>

00:09:54.570 --> 00:09:56.520
S-Say, Micchan.

00:09:57.660 --> 00:09:58.790
What is it?

00:09:59.180 --> 00:10:00.230
If...

00:10:00.660 --> 00:10:04.830
If Kana ever stopped moving,
what would you...

00:10:07.160 --> 00:10:10.130
I-If you stop moving?

00:10:10.540 --> 00:10:14.840
If something like that 
ever happened, I...

00:10:14.840 --> 00:10:15.830
I...

00:10:17.800 --> 00:10:20.970
I can't think of a life without you!

00:10:20.970 --> 00:10:22.850
I'd die too!

00:10:23.820 --> 00:10:27.350
C-Calm down, Micchan! 
I was just saying "if"!

00:10:27.800 --> 00:10:29.980
I don't like that either!

00:10:29.980 --> 00:10:33.280
You're going to live with me forever!

00:10:33.280 --> 00:10:37.860
<i>At this rate, I'll have to beat them
and make them obey, I guess?</i>

00:10:38.330 --> 00:10:41.870
<i>I can't get my hands on those girls
without fighting them.</i>

00:10:44.840 --> 00:10:46.640
No! The friction!

00:10:46.640 --> 00:10:50.300
The friction
is Frisbee throwing!

00:10:53.220 --> 00:10:56.110
Are you staying over tonight?

00:10:56.280 --> 00:10:58.900
No, I'll be going home soon.

00:10:58.900 --> 00:11:01.200
I'm sure they're waiting up too.

00:11:01.200 --> 00:11:03.100
I see.

00:11:13.650 --> 00:11:16.770
Souseiseki, what are you doing?

00:11:16.920 --> 00:11:19.310
N-Nothing.

00:11:30.920 --> 00:11:35.920
Within a dream...

00:11:38.220 --> 00:11:43.240
The soul that was born...

00:11:43.240 --> 00:11:46.840
Meg-chan, you seem to be feeling...

00:11:44.270 --> 00:11:48.570
The window glass...

00:11:46.840 --> 00:11:49.360
Not eating again, huh?

00:11:48.570 --> 00:11:52.280
...is looking at you

00:11:49.360 --> 00:11:50.900
I'll come back for it later,

00:11:50.900 --> 00:11:52.280
so eat a little, okay?

00:11:52.280 --> 00:11:58.550
Putting it all into the moment

00:12:02.520 --> 00:12:03.800
You must be an idiot.

00:12:09.240 --> 00:12:12.400
Did you think I'd come if you sang?

00:12:12.400 --> 00:12:13.790
How stupid.

00:12:15.920 --> 00:12:17.790
But you did come.

00:12:21.910 --> 00:12:22.700
See?

00:12:23.040 --> 00:12:24.700
Oh, I get it.

00:12:24.880 --> 00:12:26.110
So that's how it works.

00:12:26.110 --> 00:12:27.200
Hello.

00:12:28.180 --> 00:12:29.820
Studying?

00:12:30.850 --> 00:12:31.670
Oh, yes.

00:12:32.060 --> 00:12:33.720
Perfect timing.

00:12:33.720 --> 00:12:36.140
You have a chance to 
see something great.

00:12:41.100 --> 00:12:42.560
Pardon us.

00:12:42.560 --> 00:12:44.380
It's okay if they watch, right?

00:12:45.020 --> 00:12:45.980
Yeah.

00:12:47.140 --> 00:12:49.030
What's about to start?

00:12:49.580 --> 00:12:52.620
He is going to breathe 
life into that doll now.

00:12:53.010 --> 00:12:54.190
Life?

00:13:04.920 --> 00:13:06.340
It's going to move...

00:13:23.280 --> 00:13:28.260
Next up, we'll be bringing unusual footage
and event information...

00:13:28.750 --> 00:13:30.040
Flower garden...

00:13:30.040 --> 00:13:32.760
Kneel down and lick my shoes...

00:13:35.520 --> 00:13:36.460
What?

00:13:36.860 --> 00:13:39.100
Shinku, what happened?

00:13:41.300 --> 00:13:42.210
Nothing happened.

00:13:42.630 --> 00:13:44.910
You're lying. 
I can tell.

00:13:44.910 --> 00:13:47.720
You've clearly changed 
in the last few days.

00:13:47.720 --> 00:13:49.460
What in the world happened?

00:13:49.740 --> 00:13:50.800
Well...

00:13:51.580 --> 00:13:53.250
It's not that I changed.

00:13:53.250 --> 00:13:55.950
Perhaps it's accurate 
to say I've realized.

00:13:56.620 --> 00:13:57.950
Realized?

00:13:58.470 --> 00:14:02.690
What it is that I ought 
to do and want to do...

00:14:03.140 --> 00:14:05.930
What you want to do?

00:14:11.310 --> 00:14:13.170
So noisy!

00:14:22.570 --> 00:14:23.450
Kanaria!

00:14:27.740 --> 00:14:29.120
What is the meaning of this, you?

00:14:30.510 --> 00:14:32.620
We're starting the Alice Game.

00:14:33.160 --> 00:14:34.220
First Movement!

00:14:34.550 --> 00:14:36.290
Attack Waltz!

00:14:41.640 --> 00:14:45.240
Puny Ichigo,
 wake up already!

00:14:46.230 --> 00:14:47.600
Next up, Second Movement!

00:14:47.890 --> 00:14:49.400
Chaser Canon!

00:14:52.170 --> 00:14:54.640
No! My ears are pounding!

00:14:54.850 --> 00:14:56.580
Damn you, Kanaria!

00:14:56.960 --> 00:15:00.360
We've been so nice,
and you had to get all cocky!

00:15:01.810 --> 00:15:02.880
Pizzicato!

00:15:04.290 --> 00:15:05.490
Discord!

00:15:12.700 --> 00:15:14.190
Time to finish this, I guess?

00:15:17.160 --> 00:15:19.730
Kanaria, let's stop this already!

00:15:20.730 --> 00:15:22.360
What are you saying?

00:15:22.360 --> 00:15:23.100
Let go!

00:15:28.530 --> 00:15:30.240
You won't get away with this!

00:15:30.240 --> 00:15:32.610
I am breaking that damn violin!

00:15:32.960 --> 00:15:34.160
Not so fast!

00:15:34.160 --> 00:15:35.840
Counterattack Partita!

00:15:40.460 --> 00:15:41.490
Suiseiseki!

00:15:43.330 --> 00:15:45.220
If you will admit defeat...

00:15:45.720 --> 00:15:48.750
If you say you'll follow my orders...

00:15:48.750 --> 00:15:50.690
...I'd be willing to stop, I guess?

00:15:50.940 --> 00:15:51.920
Orders?

00:15:51.920 --> 00:15:54.900
You think we'd meekly do as you say?

00:15:56.680 --> 00:15:59.410
That's why... 
That's why I'll defeat you.

00:15:59.680 --> 00:16:03.490
And for Micchan's sake too!
I'll win, no matter what!

00:16:05.270 --> 00:16:06.930
Final Movement!

00:16:07.400 --> 00:16:09.250
Destruction Symphony!

00:16:16.930 --> 00:16:19.390
S-Stop this, you!

00:16:24.250 --> 00:16:27.090
K-Kanaria!

00:16:27.760 --> 00:16:30.770
If you're serious, then I'll...

00:16:39.970 --> 00:16:40.810
Shinku.

00:16:48.400 --> 00:16:51.060
Flower petals won't be 
able to stop my music!

00:16:51.790 --> 00:16:53.300
We shall see about that.

00:16:58.140 --> 00:16:59.200
T-This is...

00:17:08.600 --> 00:17:10.010
Ow...

00:17:13.430 --> 00:17:15.040
S-Shinku!

00:17:30.060 --> 00:17:31.550
Clean it up.

00:17:32.520 --> 00:17:34.640
That room you
 made a mess of.

00:17:34.640 --> 00:17:35.800
Hurry up and clean it up.

00:17:38.670 --> 00:17:41.540
A-A-All right, I guess!

00:17:50.590 --> 00:17:52.940
Oh, Sakurada-san!

00:18:03.010 --> 00:18:06.390
I-I'm finally done, I guess?

00:18:06.930 --> 00:18:08.820
Good work!

00:18:09.200 --> 00:18:11.100
You brought it on yourself.

00:18:11.100 --> 00:18:13.900
It's punishment for the disrespect
you showed us.

00:18:17.440 --> 00:18:19.040
Tell me one thing.

00:18:19.380 --> 00:18:21.580
Why did you try to defeat us?

00:18:21.990 --> 00:18:23.940
I-I was...

00:18:24.230 --> 00:18:26.580
I was doing it for Micchan...

00:18:26.960 --> 00:18:29.820
Micchan wants all of you...

00:18:30.160 --> 00:18:34.340
What does this Micchan-san
intend to do once she has us?

00:18:35.000 --> 00:18:38.830
We'll play together and 
cook and play dress up.

00:18:39.780 --> 00:18:40.760
I see.

00:18:41.080 --> 00:18:43.430
Then this problem is solved.

00:18:50.540 --> 00:18:52.170
Oh, yes.

00:18:52.560 --> 00:18:55.540
Yes. I took care of that matter earlier.

00:18:55.740 --> 00:18:56.580
Yes.

00:18:56.850 --> 00:18:58.680
I checked over the material by e-mail.

00:18:59.600 --> 00:19:01.180
Yes. Yes.

00:19:01.750 --> 00:19:02.830
I understand.

00:19:02.830 --> 00:19:04.590
I'll have it
compiled by tomorrow...

00:19:06.210 --> 00:19:08.190
Hey. Hello? Hello?

00:19:09.150 --> 00:19:11.190
What's wrong?
 Is it the signal?

00:19:11.630 --> 00:19:13.960
Hello? Hello?

00:19:16.260 --> 00:19:17.930
I'm back, Micchan!

00:19:17.930 --> 00:19:19.710
Kana brought them!

00:19:19.710 --> 00:19:21.940
We only deigned to come!

00:19:22.220 --> 00:19:23.470
So you are Micchan-san?

00:19:24.460 --> 00:19:25.720
It's not a dream, right?

00:19:25.720 --> 00:19:26.940
You're the real thing?

00:19:26.940 --> 00:19:28.840
The real thing is just so much better!

00:19:31.700 --> 00:19:32.990
Look, look!

00:19:32.990 --> 00:19:36.160
I bought these for when 
you all came over!

00:19:36.160 --> 00:19:37.520
Try them on!

00:19:37.740 --> 00:19:40.080
Or rather, let me take pictures of you!

00:19:40.080 --> 00:19:41.020
Please!

00:19:42.430 --> 00:19:43.550
Stay away!
 Don't touch me!

00:19:43.550 --> 00:19:45.020
Don't hug me!

00:20:00.800 --> 00:20:03.810
Great! Great!
 You guys are the best!

00:20:04.050 --> 00:20:08.440
Shinku, I don't care what you say,
you're giving too much freedom!

00:20:08.440 --> 00:20:10.530
Shinku-chan! 
Suiseiseki-chan!

00:20:10.860 --> 00:20:11.820
You're the best!

00:20:12.240 --> 00:20:14.320
She certainly is Kanaria's medium.

00:20:14.930 --> 00:20:16.540
She defies the ordinary.

00:20:16.540 --> 00:20:18.320
Hina's having lots of fun!

00:20:19.320 --> 00:20:20.460
Are you?

00:20:20.460 --> 00:20:21.640
I'm glad.

00:20:21.640 --> 00:20:22.760
I swear!

00:20:22.760 --> 00:20:24.560
There are so many
 kinds of humans.

00:20:35.220 --> 00:20:36.490
Incredible!

00:20:36.780 --> 00:20:37.770
I'm just overwhelmed!

00:20:39.240 --> 00:20:40.530
You're all so equally wonderful!

00:20:40.530 --> 00:20:42.510
She's a pro photographer!

00:20:42.770 --> 00:20:44.930
I've got lots of other outfits!

00:20:44.930 --> 00:20:46.170
Yay!

00:20:46.170 --> 00:20:47.860
Come on, 
keep on changing!

00:20:47.860 --> 00:20:49.320
I'll keep on taking photos!

00:20:53.780 --> 00:20:55.890
Oh, that was so much fun!

00:20:55.890 --> 00:20:57.240
I swear.

00:20:57.240 --> 00:20:59.330
What a terrible ordeal that was.

00:20:59.810 --> 00:21:00.360
Shinku.

00:21:02.680 --> 00:21:04.990
Why didn't you fight?

00:21:06.710 --> 00:21:08.800
There was no need to fight.

00:21:08.800 --> 00:21:12.100
But Kanaria came to engage 
in the Alice Game.

00:21:12.770 --> 00:21:13.930
Yes.

00:21:13.930 --> 00:21:15.480
Yet you...

00:21:16.220 --> 00:21:17.850
Do you wish to fight?

00:21:18.650 --> 00:21:19.640
I...

00:21:20.120 --> 00:21:22.220
If that is my fate.

00:21:23.010 --> 00:21:26.350
I do not wish to lose anything anymore.

00:21:27.180 --> 00:21:30.830
So I will not fight anymore.

00:21:31.940 --> 00:21:33.330
Shinku...

00:21:43.560 --> 00:21:47.340
Do you mean to
 abandon the Alice Game?

00:21:48.340 --> 00:21:51.270
Shinku, that is...

00:22:02.250 --> 00:22:03.590
Father!

00:23:42.250 --> 00:23:45.590
Hey, that is Suiseiseki's 
usual seat, you!

00:23:45.920 --> 00:23:47.820
That's not my problem, I guess!

00:23:47.820 --> 00:23:50.460
If Kanaria, the brainiest 
Rozen Maiden...

00:23:50.460 --> 00:23:52.790
...says it's her seat, 
then it is, I guess!

00:23:53.240 --> 00:23:56.510
You big forehead doll, 
don't be so spoiled!

00:23:56.510 --> 00:23:59.030
Souseiseki, say something to her!

00:23:59.570 --> 00:24:01.640
She's not around?

00:24:01.640 --> 00:24:03.650
Jun's not either.

00:24:03.650 --> 00:24:06.350
Next time on Rozen Maiden Träumend.

00:24:05.310 --> 00:24:10.850
Chapter 8
Doll Maker

00:24:06.350 --> 00:24:09.370
Its melody is like a dream, I guess?
